From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:53:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] A lesson's news reaches the person who acts on it

Four send-push cases: a report draft ready, to the teacher who taught; a
follow-up the teacher approved, to the room's in-charges; a practice set
to do at home, to the student and the household; a set finished, to the
teacher who set it, flagged when the integrity summary said so. Daily's
ready transcript finalises the lesson again; recordings the retention
sweep marked deleted leave Daily through recordings-cleanup.

