+}
+
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// A practice set to do at home → the student and the household.
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+/**
+ * Only a set for home is news to a phone. An in-session set is handed over
+ * in the room itself — assign_practice inserts those under app.push_quiet,
+ * so the trigger never posts them — and the mode is checked here as well,
+ * because a quiet write is the trigger's promise and a wrong audience is
