+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// An at-home set finished → the teacher who set it.
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+/**
+ * The attempt's status leaving in_progress is the one moment worth a buzz:
+ * submitted (worked answers wait for the teacher's marks) or marked (every
